  "setting": "漂木根盤散落的退潮灘",
  "subtitle": "",
  "subtitle_en": "",
  "lead": "她拾起木枝，沿著水走向海。鳥仍在往返；一束木漸漸變輕，手終於空了。海沒有因此安靜，她也沒有離開。",
  "lead_en": "She carries wood toward the sea. The bird keeps returning. A bundle becomes a branch, then an empty hand. The tide continues. She stays.",
  "statement_title": "",
  "statement": "她拾起木枝，沿著水走向海。鳥仍在往返；一束木漸漸變輕，手終於空了。海沒有因此安靜，她也沒有離開。\n\n潮水回來的時候，\n她把一枝木留在乾地，\n讓鳥自己決定下一趟。",
  "statement_en": "She carries wood toward the sea. The bird keeps returning. A bundle becomes a branch, then an empty hand. The tide continues. She stays.\n\nWhen the tide returns,\nshe leaves a branch on dry sand.\nThe bird chooses its next journey.",
  "afterword": "潮水回來的時候，\n她把一枝木留在乾地，\n讓鳥自己決定下一趟。",
  "afterword_en": "When the tide returns,\nshe leaves a branch on dry sand.\nThe bird chooses its next journey.",
  "series_statement": "《神話未完成》\n史旺姬走進流傳至今的神話，留下它最核心的問題，讓它面對今天的生活。神話一直被講述、被使用，所以還沒有完成。",
  "series_statement_en": "Myths in the Making\nSwanky Ji steps into myths that are still being told, keeps the question at their heart, and lets it meet the life we live now. A myth that is still told and still used is not yet finished.",
